&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.sans.org/webcasts/mitre-att-ck-sigma-alerting-110010&#34;  title=&#34;MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK® and Sigma Alerting&#34;
